    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW29f7oazwAC2Eh51x1XcYfuA)_\n\n## What\n\n- **vertico queued as dependency of vertico-posframe**: `sp-posframe` loads before `sp-minibuffer` (which requires `sp-completion`, where `vertico` is declared), so Elpaca queued `vertico` as a dependency first. `sp-posframe` now `require`s `sp-completion` before its `use-package`.\n- **tooltips.css / tooltips.js missing**: the package keeps its code and the two tooltip files in `lisp/`; the recipe is now `:files (\"lisp/*.el\" \"lisp/tooltips.css\" \"lisp/tooltips.js\")`.\n- **Cannot load litdb**: the `litdb.el` header has no `Package-Requires`, so `hydra`/`request`/`counsel` were not installed (`openalex` comes from `org-ref`). `request` and `counsel` are installed, and `litdb` has `:after (hydra request counsel org-ref)`.\n- **browser-hist**: installed with `use-package` and an Elpaca recipe (`agzam/browser-hist.el`) before `consult-omni`, which waits for it with `:after`.\n\nDocs and `.el` files changed together; CHANGELOG entry added.\n\n## Tested\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container, and no tangle run); the `.el` blocks were edited identically to their docs. Recipes were checked against the upstream repositories' file layouts. Please restart Emacs and check the five messages are gone.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9DjJ1RiaewzjEB2R6)_",
